WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:01.460 line:0%
Oh, hello!

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.253 line:0%
<i>It's time for </i>Nailed It!

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:05.005 line:0%
<i>The show that's looking for this...</i>

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.882 line:0%
<i>but ends up finding this.</i>

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.970 line:0%
Put on your brave face and start...

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.222 line:0%
baking!

00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:16.642 line:0%
-Bake! What is wrong with you?
-Go, go, go, go!

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:18.748 line:0%
-Oh.
-Oh, no!

00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:20.103 line:0%
What happened?

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:23.398 position:59% line:0%
If I die because you stapled something
to food...

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:25.849 line:0%
I'm doing it with my hands.

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:28.028 line:0%
Why are you on the floor?
What are you doing?

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.239 line:0%
-Oh, God.
-Am I the only one that's lost?

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:33.033 position:56% line:0%
-No.
-I've never made anything like this.

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:36.282 line:0%
I can't do it. I give up.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:40.707 line:0%
Let's see your Marvel cupcake
and cookie toppers!

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:43.293 position:56% line:0%
-Is there an apple in there? Really?
-I'd eat it.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:45.796 line:0%
Nailed it!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.382 line:0%
That's what I was going for.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.672 line:0%
No! It's not that bad.

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:54.429 position:64% line:0%
It was like pulling a piece of pineapple
out the trash and putting it in my mouth.

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:56.848 line:0%
-Oh!
-Oh, no! Marie Antoinette again!

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:57.766 line:0%
Oh, no!

